    "reviews": "\u201cBEAT SABER FOR YOUR BODY - It\u2019s a smart, straight, no-nonsense rhythm game with an energetic core mechanic and plenty of options to tailor the experience to your liking\u201d<br>4/5 \u2013 UploadVR<br><br>\u201cA PERFECT FIT ON VR - OhShape is just as much a game of mental prowess as it is physical endurance. Focus on your head hole and let the rest of the information wash over you (...) It's a really rewarding grind, and a crazy good work out\u201d<br>The Gamer<br><br>\u201cAEROBICS IN VR - OhShape is a well-designed rhythm game that comes the closest yet to being a serious fitness experience in VR\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 6DOF Reviews<br>",
